        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-12T10:11:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there any reason for these stars, when each line looks like it\u0027s referencing a single specific class ? I think it may become dangerous when somebody adds a class to the framework with a name that has this as a prefix – the framework does have classes in the android.net and android.net.util packages, for example.\n\nI can\u0027t find a name that looks likely to be used like this, but if the stars are not necessary, I think we might be safer without them.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "206257e94ede0388c1d0454c1d8daca2950b4d72",
