        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-12T10:11:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this immediately necessary ? I\u0027m scared any of these annotations is (already or in the future) present at runtime and checked by some code. At least we control com.android.net.module, but not the two other ones.\n\nFor example, @android.annotation.SystemApi is retained at runtime. I don\u0027t know if any code is using this fact and might trip the module, but if there isn\u0027t an immediate imperative need in S I would prefer we don\u0027t remove them now (and if there is, please document it here).",
